# Provider stand-ins (src/Stubs). Normally only the Verification service calls these; this file shows how each
# provider scenario is triggered, without changing any code.
#
#   World-Check: a marker word in the name   Match | Pep | Slow | Down        (anything else: CLEAR)
#   IDNow:       a marker inside the document image (the base64 below decodes to it)
#                IDNOW:INVALID | IDNOW:INCONCLUSIVE | IDNOW:NOFACE | IDNOW:SLOW | IDNOW:DOWN   (anything else: VALID)
#
# "Slow" waits Stubs:SlowResponseDelay (appsettings.json, default 20 seconds).

@stubs = http://localhost:5090

### IDNow: valid document, face matches
POST {{stubs}}/idnow/v1/identifications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documentType": "PASSPORT", "documentImage": "aGVsbG8=", "selfieImage": "aGVsbG8=" }

### IDNow: document INVALID (image contains IDNOW:INVALID)
POST {{stubs}}/idnow/v1/identifications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documentType": "PASSPORT", "documentImage": "SUROT1c6SU5WQUxJRA==", "selfieImage": "aGVsbG8=" }

### IDNow: document INCONCLUSIVE (IDNOW:INCONCLUSIVE)
POST {{stubs}}/idnow/v1/identifications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documentType": "ID_CARD", "documentImage": "SUROT1c6SU5DT05DTFVTSVZF", "selfieImage": "aGVsbG8=" }

### IDNow: face does not match (IDNOW:NOFACE)
POST {{stubs}}/idnow/v1/identifications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documentType": "PASSPORT", "documentImage": "SUROT1c6Tk9GQUNF", "selfieImage": "aGVsbG8=" }

### IDNow: slow (IDNOW:SLOW)
POST {{stubs}}/idnow/v1/identifications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documentType": "PASSPORT", "documentImage": "SUROT1c6U0xPVw==", "selfieImage": "aGVsbG8=" }

### IDNow: unavailable, 503 (IDNOW:DOWN)
POST {{stubs}}/idnow/v1/identifications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documentType": "PASSPORT", "documentImage": "SUROT1c6RE9XTg==", "selfieImage": "aGVsbG8=" }

### World-Check: clear
POST {{stubs}}/worldcheck/v2/screen
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Petrova", "dateOfBirth": "1991-03-04", "nationality": "MKD" }

### World-Check: possible sanctions match (name contains "Match")
POST {{stubs}}/worldcheck/v2/screen
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Match", "dateOfBirth": "1991-03-04", "nationality": "MKD" }

### World-Check: possible PEP match (name contains "Pep")
POST {{stubs}}/worldcheck/v2/screen
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Pep", "dateOfBirth": "1991-03-04", "nationality": "MKD" }

### World-Check: slow (name contains "Slow")
POST {{stubs}}/worldcheck/v2/screen
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Slow", "dateOfBirth": "1991-03-04", "nationality": "MKD" }

### World-Check: unavailable, 503 (name contains "Down")
POST {{stubs}}/worldcheck/v2/screen
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Down", "dateOfBirth": "1991-03-04", "nationality": "MKD" }

### Calls received so far (side effects: e.g. IDNow called exactly once per application)
GET {{stubs}}/_stub/calls

### Reset the call log
DELETE {{stubs}}/_stub/calls
